            <sparkle:version>199</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.13.92</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>10.13</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.13.92

- Swiping the artwork no longer misbehaves on Apple Podcasts. Podcasts has no previous or next episode to move to, so the swipe was showing the cover of a show you listened to earlier while restarting the episode you were already on, and the mismatch never corrected itself. Swiping is now inactive for podcasts.
- If a swipe does not actually change the track, the overlay now puts the real cover back instead of keeping the one it previewed.
- Amazon Music is enabled by default for new installs.
]]></description>
